   160	- **[Feature Specification](specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/spec.md)**: Complete functional requirements (FR-001 through FR-052)
   161	- **[UI Specification](specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/ui-spec.md)**: Detailed UI/UX guidelines and interaction patterns
   162	- **[Data Model](specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/data-model.md)**: Architecture documentation with 70+ implementation phases
   163	- **[Tasks](specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/tasks.md)**: Detailed task breakdown for all features
   164	- **[Deployment Guide](docs/DEPLOYMENT.md)**: Production deployment instructions
   165	- **[Google Drive Setup](docs/GOOGLE_DRIVE_SETUP.md)**: Configure Drive integration
   166	
   167	## 🧪 Testing
