   181	npm run test:e2e         # Run E2E tests headless
   182	npm run test:e2e:headed  # Run with browser UI
   183	```
   184	
   185	Test organization:
   186	- `frontend/tests/unit/` - Domain model, calculations, utilities
   187	- `frontend/tests/integration/` - Command execution, tool workflows
   188	- `frontend/tests/e2e/` - Complete user workflows
